metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 146: the Monty Mole in its cannon (Cannon + Chorobei), Pinna Beach's three-barrelled cannon. Put it on the ground facing the way it should start (+Z is its front). It turns to face you; within 40 m the mole on top lobs a Bob-omb at you every 1.7 s (the bomb lands and walks at you, then blows); come within 6.7 m and the mole ducks inside until you are 20 m off. To beat it: pick up a Bob-omb it threw (hose it first so it sits dizzy, then B) and throw it (B) so it blows up on the mole -- three hits and the mole collapses, the cannon blows and stays as a prop. Its barrels fire Bullet Bills at long range only if you give it one in Shots > KillerScene (none yet). Knobs: Deviations (SpeedScale, MoleHeightUnits, HitPoints), Shots (the Bob-omb, the Bullet Bill), Effects (the blast, slots), Sounds (seven slots)."

